		"title": "An object with a local the whole program shares a name for",
		"kind": "object",
		"command": "ld -o prog a.o b.o",
		"request": "a.o: .data holds the four bytes 10, and the symbol `lv` that names them has STB_LOCAL in the top nibble of st_info. Its .rela.text entry for `add eax, [rip+lv]` points at that local symbol's index *in this object's* .symtab",
